Movement step:

```
function step() {
  if (state === 'gameover') return;
  if (state === 'ready') { state = 'running'; updateHud('进行中'); }

  direction = nextDirection;   // 每 tick 最多应用一次
  var head = snake[0];
  var nx = head.x + direction.x;
  var ny = head.y + direction.y;

  if (nx < 0 || nx >= COLS || ny < 0 || ny >= ROWS) { endGame(); return; }

  var eating = (food && nx === food.x && ny === food.y);
  var bodyLimit = eating ? snake.length : snake.length - 1;
  for (var i = 0; i < bodyLimit; i++) {
    if (snake[i].x === nx && snake[i].y === ny) { endGame(); return; }
  }

  snake.unshift({x:nx, y:ny});
  if (eating) {
    score += 1;
    updateScore();
    spawnFood();   // if no empty cell -> endGame (victory as gameover)
    if (state === 'gameover') { render(); return; }  // spawnFood might end
  } else {
    snake.pop();
  }
  render();
}
```

Careful with spawnFood when board full: contract "无空格即视为棋盘占满，结束本局（胜利态，按 gameover 处理）". If snake fills board after eating, no empty cells, endGame. But then HUD score updated before. Implement spawnFood returns boolean; if false, endGame and maybe set status "游戏结束（胜利）"? Contract just gameover. Keep status text consistent maybe "游戏结束"; overlay final score. Could set status '游戏结束'. Simpler: endGame() uses status '游戏结束'. For victory maybe same. Fine. But ensure no further processing.

